# Per-shape apps emitted by scripts/gen_decode_shape_app.sh. Generated from the matmul source
# plus MATMUL_DECODE_SPLIT; the ELF is copied to hardware/ and is standalone, so the app dir is
# a build artifact. Committing generated shape apps is what left 1064 sp-fp16-* files in the
# tree; do not repeat it for decode.
software/apps/spatz_apps/sp-decode-*/
